  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-59757\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-960x927.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"193\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-960x927.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-768x741.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-1024x988.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-1200x1158.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-720x695.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Summer-Sale-3-540x521.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>You asked for more merch, and we answered! We’re rolling out new items on the store at DrGreger.org and celebrating with a flash sale. (As always, all proceeds go directly to support NutritionFacts.org). One of the requests has been for organic and US-made shirts, so check out the new designs <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/swag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/swag\">here</a>. Fill this vibrant new <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/daily-dozen-tote-bag\">tote bag</a> with all of your greens, beans, and berries. And slap our <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach\">new stickers</a> onto your laptop, water bottle, or bike.  </p>\n<p>From now until July 21, get 15% off all new merchandise (note: discount is automatically applied at checkout). See them all at <a href=\"https://drgreger.org\">DrGreger.org</a> under Swag and Outreach.</p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Fasting Webinar Next Week</h4>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-59753 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-1200x1199.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Fasting-Webinar-IG-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>There’s one more day to register for my webinar on intermittent fasting on July 26<sup>th</sup> at 2pm ET. Registration ends July 19th midnight (ET). I’ll cover the pros and cons of calorie restriction and water-only fasting for weight loss, alternate-day fasting, body fat, longevity and metabolic health, the 5:2 diet, fasting-mimicking diets, and time-restricted feeding – and I will be answering questions live throughout. The focus for this webinar will be on weight control, but I am planning to do a second webinar in September on water-only and Buchinger modified fasting for other conditions such as blood pressure, autoimmune disease, and cancer.<p></p>\n<p>All of the information will eventually be available for free on NutritionFacts.org, but for a donation to our 501c3 non-profit, you can hear it all first and ask questions right on the spot. To register for the intermittent fasting webinar, visit <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/intermittent-fasting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-is-link=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/intermittent-fasting/\">https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/intermittent-fasting</a>. </p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><strong>UPDATE</strong>: Thanks to everyone who attended the webinar. If you missed it, the digital download is available here: <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads</a>. </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"display: flow-root;\">\n<h4 class=\"null\">Become a Monthly Supporter</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-59760\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Monthly-Supporter-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/> We rely heavily on our recurring monthly donors. Please consider becoming a monthly supporter and help ensure our work can continue to serve millions around the world. Simply use <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/donation.jsp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this form</a> and choose the “recurring-monthly” option. And, if you donate at least $15 each month, you’ll receive early access to our videos every month before they’re shared with the world. Thank you so much for your support.\n</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Hiring App Developer</h4>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-57835\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG.png 649w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG-540x539.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>As I get ready to release my new book, <em>How Not to Diet</em>, my team is working on updating my Dr. Greger’s Daily Dozen app to include my new recommendations and other enhancements. We are seeking an experienced app developer to work on this project. For more information and to apply, go <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/employment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. </div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Interviewed on Fox Business</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-59770\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-960x538.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-960x538.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-768x430.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-1024x573.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-1200x672.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-720x403.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM-540x302.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/07/Screen-Shot-2019-07-15-at-3.17.08-PM.png 1918w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>I was honored to be interviewed on Mornings with Maria a few weeks ago. Check out the clip <a href=\"https://video.foxbusiness.com/v/6052464414001/?fbclid=IwAR3t0GGA4Dyn1AydOQ4ns7kjBHrNp-uEvtqjwWdK-7UE0p5Qst1Evm5c9Y4#sp=show-clips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://video.foxbusiness.com/v/6052464414001/?fbclid=IwAR3t0GGA4Dyn1AydOQ4ns7kjBHrNp-uEvtqjwWdK-7UE0p5Qst1Evm5c9Y4#sp=show-clips\">here</a>.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;A July 25</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"199\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\"/></a>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>July 25</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3Dafe9299fd2%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEIgGkyjkXIfYHCVfz6o5PQOxSkhw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D88539af304%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEvfR6sb4jzTlryjwFO0t9k3RiaJA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D9c5c1ac6dc%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoL2STvivkREYbL3IbSQpGMo_YSw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<p>In health,</p>\n<p><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
